        "text": "Kimberly Neely DuBuclet is the State Representative for Illinois' 5th District. She previously served as vice president of the Metropolitan Water Reclamation District of Greater Chicago board, Legislative and Community Affairs Director for the Chicago Park District, and on a U.S. Environmental Protection Agency advisory committee.",
